<title>JAPAN: OSE to name firms eligible to list stock options.</title>
<headline>OSE to name firms eligible to list stock options.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Monday that it would announce at 0700 GMT which firms will be allowed to list stock options on the exchange this July.</p>
</text>
